#: ../../source/agent/approvals.rst:2
msgid "Approvals, Trust, and Recovery"
msgstr "审批、信任与恢复"

#: ../../source/agent/approvals.rst:4
msgid ""
"Daedalus separates reading, verification, proposals, writes, and "
"destructive operations. Writes and risky external operations go through "
"the approval gateway according to the selected approval mode."
msgstr "Daedalus 将读取、验证、提案、写入和破坏性操作分开。写入和高风险外部操作会根据选定的审批模式经过审批网关。"

#: ../../source/agent/approvals.rst:9
msgid "Approval modes"
msgstr "审批模式"

#: ../../source/agent/approvals.rst:11
msgid "Manual"
msgstr "手动"

#: ../../source/agent/approvals.rst:12
msgid ""
"Ask before actions that require approval. This is the best default while "
"you are learning a project or reviewing unfamiliar integrations."
msgstr "对需要审批的操作先询问。这是了解项目或审查不熟悉集成时最合适的默认设置。"

#: ../../source/agent/approvals.rst:15
msgid "Auto-safe"
msgstr "自动安全"

#: ../../source/agent/approvals.rst:16
msgid ""
"Allow operations classified as safe while still pausing for higher-risk "
"actions. Check the tool description and the requested scope before "
"relying on this mode."
msgstr "允许被归类为安全的操作，同时对更高风险的操作暂停。依赖此模式前，请检查工具说明和请求范围。"

#: ../../source/agent/approvals.rst:20
msgid "Full trust"
msgstr "完全信任"

#: ../../source/agent/approvals.rst:21
msgid ""
"Disable the OS sandbox and automatically approve all tools for the "
"session. Use this only for a trusted local project and a request whose "
"scope you understand. It does not make a model correct, and it does not "
"turn an untrusted MCP server into a trusted one."
msgstr "禁用操作系统沙箱，并自动批准会话中的所有工具。仅当本地项目可信且你理解请求范围时使用此模式。它不会让模型变得正确，也不会将不可信的 MCP server 变成可信。"

#: ../../source/agent/approvals.rst:26
msgid ""
"The approval mode is a convenience setting, not a replacement for version"
" control or code review. Keep important projects in Git and review "
"destructive actions individually."
msgstr "审批模式是便利设置，不能替代版本控制或代码审查。请将重要项目置于 Git 中，并逐项审查破坏性操作。"

#: ../../source/agent/approvals.rst:31
msgid "What an approval prompt means"
msgstr "审批提示意味着什么"

#: ../../source/agent/approvals.rst:33
msgid ""
"When Studio asks **Approve tool execution?**, read the tool name, target,"
" command, and scope before pressing **Approve**. A cross-workspace action"
" may also ask you to type a consent phrase. Reject the action when the "
"target is unclear, the command is broader than the request, or the result"
" can be achieved with a safer read-only operation."
msgstr "Studio 显示 **Approve tool execution?** 时，请在按下 **Approve** 前阅读工具名称、目标、命令和范围。跨工作区操作还可能要求你输入同意短语。当目标不明确、命令范围大于请求，或可以通过更安全的只读操作实现结果时，请拒绝该操作。"

#: ../../source/agent/approvals.rst:40
msgid "Plan approval"
msgstr "计划审批"

#: ../../source/agent/approvals.rst:42
msgid ""
"In Plan mode, Studio can show **Approve plan?** before execution. Read "
"the steps in order and check that the plan names the right files, tools, "
"and verification. Choose **Revise** and describe what to change if the "
"plan is too broad, misses a constraint, or uses the wrong approach. "
"Approving a plan starts execution; it is not the same as approving every "
"future destructive action."
msgstr "在 Plan 模式中，Studio 可以在执行前显示 **Approve plan?**。请按顺序阅读步骤，并检查计划是否列出了正确的文件、工具和验证方式。如果计划范围过大、遗漏约束或方法错误，请选择 **Revise** 并说明需要修改的内容。批准计划会开始执行；这不等于批准未来的每一项破坏性操作。"

#: ../../source/agent/approvals.rst:50
msgid "Clarification requests"
msgstr "澄清请求"

#: ../../source/agent/approvals.rst:52
msgid ""
"If the plan needs information, Studio shows **Clarification needed** with"
" suggested replies and a field for your own answer. Choose the suggested "
"reply only when it matches your intent. **Skip and continue** lets the "
"agent make assumptions from the available context; use it only when the "
"missing detail is not important. You can add the missing constraint in a "
"later message and revise the plan."
msgstr "如果计划需要更多信息，Studio 会显示 **Clarification needed**、建议回复和自定义回答字段。只有建议回复符合你的意图时才选择它。**Skip and continue** 会让 agent 根据现有上下文进行假设；仅当缺失细节不重要时使用。你可以在之后的消息中补充缺失约束并修改计划。"

#: ../../source/agent/approvals.rst:60
msgid "Tool budget decisions"
msgstr "工具预算决策"

#: ../../source/agent/approvals.rst:62
msgid ""
"Long runs can pause when they reach a tool-call count or tool-result size"
" limit. The dialog shows the limit that was reached, steps used, result "
"size, and the extra budget requested. Choose:"
msgstr "长时间运行达到工具调用次数或工具结果大小限制时，可能会暂停。对话框会显示已达到的限制、已使用的步骤、结果大小以及请求增加的预算。请选择："

#: ../../source/agent/approvals.rst:66
msgid ""
"**Continue** when the current direction is correct and needs more tool "
"work;"
msgstr "当前方向正确且需要更多工具工作时选择 **Continue**；"

#: ../../source/agent/approvals.rst:67
msgid "**Summarize with current results** when you want a useful stopping point;"
msgstr "想要一个有用的停止点时选择 **Summarize with current results**；"

#: ../../source/agent/approvals.rst:68
msgid "**Cancel this run** when the task should stop."
msgstr "任务应停止时选择 **Cancel this run**。"

#: ../../source/agent/approvals.rst:70
msgid ""
"More budget means more execution, not more certainty. Read the current "
"results before continuing."
msgstr "更多预算意味着更多执行，不意味着更高确定性。继续前请阅读当前结果。"

#: ../../source/agent/approvals.rst:74
msgid "Pause and resume"
msgstr "暂停和恢复"

#: ../../source/agent/approvals.rst:76
msgid ""
"A run can pause because it needs approval, has reached a tool budget, "
"needs a clarification, or has been interrupted. Studio persists the run "
"state and its evidence. Continuing a paused run does not intentionally "
"replay successful writes."
msgstr "运行可能因为需要审批、达到工具预算、需要澄清或被中断而暂停。Studio 会持久化运行状态及其证据。继续暂停的运行不会有意重放已经成功的写入。"

#: ../../source/agent/approvals.rst:81
msgid ""
"After an application or backend interruption, Studio marks active work as"
" interrupted. Retry from the recorded checkpoint after checking the "
"workspace and the current Git diff. A retry uses write fingerprints and "
"prior evidence to reduce duplicate effects, but you should still inspect "
"the resulting diff."
msgstr "应用或后端中断后，Studio 会将活动工作标记为已中断。检查工作区和当前 Git diff 后，从记录的检查点重试。重试会使用写入指纹和既有证据来减少重复影响，但你仍应检查生成的 diff。"

#: ../../source/agent/approvals.rst:87
msgid "External integrations"
msgstr "外部集成"

#: ../../source/agent/approvals.rst:89
msgid ""
"Custom MCP servers, custom providers, browser automation, terminal "
"commands, and Skills can expand what a request can reach. Before enabling"
" one, review its endpoint or command, environment variables, requested "
"tools, and approval behavior. Secrets must stay in the appropriate "
"credential or secret store and out of prompts, logs, and screenshots."
msgstr "自定义 MCP server、自定义供应商、浏览器自动化、终端命令和 Skill 都可以扩大请求能够触及的范围。启用前，请检查其 endpoint 或命令、环境变量、请求的工具和审批行为。Secret 必须保存在适当的凭据或 secret store 中，不得出现在提示词、日志和截图里。"
